# This directory is the build context of the image beside it, and compose
# uploads the context whole on every build. The host eval venv (setup-eval-host.sh)
# lives inside it: numpy, scipy, onnxruntime and scikit-learn are hundreds of MB,
# so without this line every `docker compose build` uploads them for no reason -
# the image copies nothing from the context anyway (the sources are mounted).
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
